### How to Add This to Your GitHub Repo
1. Go to `[https://github.com/NadiaAli21/quiet-rooms](https://github.com/NadiaAli21/quiet-rooms)` and click on **`README.md`**.
2. Click the **pencil icon** (Edit this file) in the top right corner of the file view.
3. Paste the Markdown above, scroll down, and click **Commit changes**.

